    "detailed_description": "Collect keys and solve puzzles to collect your christmas gifts. But be careful there is a lurking evil santa that knows your every move, and whatever you do don't go to the basement.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745250/extras/6e9d6524b69c8a5bfdf4def1845410b7.avif?t=1710089126\" width=290 height=90 /></span><br> <ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li>Challenging<br>  </li><li>Speedrunning<br>  </li><li>Jump Scares<br>  </li><li>Problem Solving<br>  </li><li>Milk &amp; Cookies<br>  </li><li>Christmas Spirit</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745250/extras/8c47e43d36493395bbdbd31db867037f.avif?t=1710089126\" width=290 height=90 /></span><br>In Bad Santa use your speed and agility to avoid Santa, he hears and sees everything. Solve puzzles, find clues, and collect keys to help find your well earned christmas gifts and bring the christmas spirit back to your neighborhood.<br><br><u><strong>Gather keys to open doors:</strong></u><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745250/extras/1c2e3acc30c30218c53142a57db7540d.poster.avif?t=1710089126\" width=244 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745250/extras/1c2e3acc30c30218c53142a57db7540d.webm?t=1710089126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745250/extras/1c2e3acc30c30218c53142a57db7540d.mp4?t=1710089126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>Complete different types of puzzles:</strong></u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam